WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.405 --> 00:00:20.531
Hi! Who are you?

2
00:00:20.532 --> 00:00:23.755
I'm a koala.

3
00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:28.552
Koalas are marsupials.

4
00:00:28.553 --> 00:00:34.330
Female marsupials carry their babies in pouches.

5
00:00:34.331 --> 00:00:37.284
Where do you live?

6
00:00:37.285 --> 00:00:40.789
Koalas live in Australia.

7
00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:44.148
We like forests.

8
00:00:44.149 --> 00:00:47.614
We like to be in trees.

9
00:00:47.615 --> 00:00:50.819
Are you a good climber?

10
00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:59.480
Koalas are great climbers.

11
00:00:59.481 --> 00:01:05.481
We use our feet to grab branches.

12
00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:08.338
Is that your tree?

13
00:01:08.339 --> 00:01:13.779
Yes. Each koala has its own trees.

14
00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:23.061
We mark our trees with scratches.

15
00:01:23.062 --> 00:01:28.714
Male koalas mark their trees with their scent.

16
00:01:28.715 --> 00:01:32.000
Where do you sleep?

17
00:01:32.001 --> 00:01:35.912
Koalas sleep up in the trees.

18
00:01:35.913 --> 00:01:40.523
We sleep for most of the day!

19
00:01:40.524 --> 00:01:43.900
What do you eat?

20
00:01:43.901 --> 00:01:49.293
Koalas eat leaves from one kind of tree.

21
00:01:49.294 --> 00:01:53.038
We have pouches in our cheeks.

22
00:01:53.039 --> 00:01:57.328
We store extra leaves in them.

23
00:01:57.329 --> 00:02:00.692
Who are your enemies?

24
00:02:00.693 --> 00:02:05.403
We're usually safe in our trees.

25
00:02:05.404 --> 00:02:17.494
But wild dogs and owls sometimes eat koalas.

26
00:02:17.495 --> 00:02:22.525
I'm tired from eating so many leaves!

27
00:02:22.526 --> 00:02:29.293
I'm going to sleep now.

28
00:02:29.294 --> 00:02:35.892
Good-bye, Koala!
